{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼、唔呼、唔呼呼呼……♪”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0294", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，那是怎样？”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "ht0580", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么怎样？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“万智老师啦，万智老师。最近，她总是一个人莫名其妙地贼笑。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "ht0581", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会是交到男朋友了？”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也这样猜。如果真的是这样，大家要祝福她才行。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "ht0582", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以这时候就需要你了，新吾。”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "ht0583", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇，又丢事情给我了。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“别这样说嘛。你去问万智老师确认真相。这样大家都能幸福了。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "ht0584", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……果然又变成这样。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太拍拍我的肩膀，把我推向万智老师。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼……呼呼、唔呼呼♪”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0295", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住回头看隼太，露出“没问题吗？”的表情。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "万智老师看着手里的照片，非常快乐的样子。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然是交到男朋友了吧。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……万智老师，你是不是发生什么好事了？”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，你问得非常好，新吾君……”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0296", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被她用闪闪发亮的双眼注视，我有点招架不住。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她是一直在等着有谁来问她……", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“老师好像很快乐的样子。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊，古德利安太可爱了♪”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0297", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“古德利安？”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是猫啦，猫。我开始养小猫了。那孩子的名字就叫做古德利安。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0298", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这就是所谓的可爱到要融化的孩子啊。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0299", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是第一次养猫，没想到居然会这么可爱……”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0300", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我还帮它买了衣服喔♪因为太可爱了，不管穿什么都好适合～”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0301", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，下次要买什么衣服给它穿呢？唔呼呼、唔呼呼呼♪”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 318, "voice": "mc0302", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，看来要无视她会比较好。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "万智老师觉得幸福的话，这样也好。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为学生的我们没有多嘴的余地。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……她是末期了吧。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 351, "voice": "ht0585", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就说不要多嘴了！", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼嗯，八冢老师啊……”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "ar4371", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我懂她的心情。”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sk1310", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃也喜欢猫吗？”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "ar4372", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我喜欢动物。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sk1311", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那哥哥呢？”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "ar4373", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学，我不懂你这个问题的意思。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喜欢动物。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sk1312", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，我也不懂你这个回答的意思。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃学妹喜欢Animal的新吾同学呢。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "ag3423", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也不懂特地用英文说动物这个词的意义在哪……”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果男人能绝种就好了。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1311", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个人的内心是我最不懂的。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得出这个结论，我好难过。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐，你觉得动物性的男人怎么样呢？”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1312", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“动物性的男人？”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mu1243", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是像这个新吾一样，一年到头都在发情，随时随地都可以开始交配的男人。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1313", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我未免也被说得太差劲了吧。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为男人，我也讨厌那样动物性的人。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……但是新吾君不是那种随时随地就交配的人吧？”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mu1244", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到学姐口中说出“交配”这个词，我心脏猛然一跳。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，这个男人绝对到处交配。随时随地、谁都可以。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1314", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……纱凪说出交配这个词倒是没什么违和感。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同样都是女孩子，还真是不可思议。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哥哥没有被交配过。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sk1313", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要是‘被’也太惨了……”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "ar4374", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“交配这种事，清纯的少女是不能说的。交配这种事……交配这种事！”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "ag3424", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不要去理说得比谁都开心的安洁吧。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想拒绝Animal新吾这个称号。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂，Animal。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1315", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像不行。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我说你啊，就算不是有意的也不准幻想跟美羽学姐交配喔！”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1316", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了好了，到此为止。这种话对美羽学姐也很失礼吧？”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼，不要以为这样说我就会上当。我可是知道的！”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1317", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“男人和母的在密室里两人独处的时候，野性就会觉醒变得没有分寸。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1318", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她这种偏见到底是从哪里学来的。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且还说母的……", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐也请小心点喔。Animal新吾绝对在打你的主意！”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1319", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我实在不想从此就被叫这个绰号。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，新吾君才不是那样的人呢对吧～？”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mu1245", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“老实说，我不知道该怎么回答。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然是我个人的印象，但新吾君好像会非常温柔地交配呢♪”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mu1246", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;“噗！？”", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "“噗！？”", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "又说这种让我无法回答的话。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由美羽学姐说出口的“交配”太写实了……", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……天羽学姐，不要一直说交配这个词比较好。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "ar4375", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，说的也是。交配是不能说也不能做的呢。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mu1247", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥的交配很温柔吗？”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sk1314", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃你不要对奇怪的事情产生兴趣。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我正值这个年纪。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sk1315", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算正值这个年纪也请自重。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sk1316", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 344, "voice": "sn1320", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
